{
  "shots": [
    {
      "sentence": "My daughter has insisted for weeks that a man lives inside her bedroom closet.",
      "search_term": "scared child bedroom",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A young girl sitting on her bed looking afraid toward a closet door.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_1.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.603,
      "start": 0.131,
      "end": 3.734
    },
    {
      "sentence": "She tells me he wears a gray suit and smells like damp earth and old library books.",
      "search_term": "dark vintage closet",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "A dark, dusty vintage suit jacket hanging in a dim closet.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_2.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 3.543,
      "start": 4.194,
      "end": 7.737
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I checked behind the sliding doors every single night, finding nothing but her hanging sundresses and a pile of discarded sneakers.",
      "search_term": "opening closet door",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person sliding open a closet door to reveal clothes hanging inside.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_3.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 6.145,
      "start": 8.238,
      "end": 14.383
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Last night, I finally decided to set up a motion-activated camera to prove to her that the closet was empty.",
      "search_term": "security camera indoor",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A small security camera being placed on a bedroom shelf.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_4.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 5.185,
      "start": 14.863,
      "end": 20.048
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I sat on the edge of her bed, watching the red light on the lens blink steadily in the darkness.",
      "search_term": "blinking red light",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "Close up of a blinking red LED light in a dark room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_5.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.422,
      "start": 20.468,
      "end": 24.89
    },
    {
      "sentence": "She fell asleep holding my hand, her breathing slow and rhythmic against the silence of the house.",
      "search_term": "holding hands bed",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A parent holding a child's hand in a dark bedroom.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_6.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.503,
      "start": 25.37,
      "end": 29.873
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I stayed until my eyelids grew heavy, eventually drifting off right there beside her.",
      "search_term": "sleeping in bed",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person resting their head on a pillow in a dark room.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_7.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.222,
      "start": 30.393,
      "end": 34.615
    },
    {
      "sentence": "When I woke up this morning, the camera was still recording, its battery light glowing a steady, reassuring green.",
      "search_term": "green light camera",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "A small camera lens glowing with a green light.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_8.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 5.683,
      "start": 34.995,
      "end": 40.678
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I took the memory card to my laptop, eager to show her the empty footage and end this silly game for good.",
      "search_term": "laptop memory card",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person inserting a memory card into a laptop computer.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_9.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.844,
      "start": 41.098,
      "end": 45.942
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The video started with the door opening at three in the morning.",
      "search_term": "creepy door opening",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A closet door slowly creaking open in the dark.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_10.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.663,
      "start": 46.323,
      "end": 48.986
    },
    {
      "sentence": "A man in a charcoal suit stepped out, his face obscured by long, matted hair.",
      "search_term": "shadowy figure standing",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark, shadowy figure standing in a doorway.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_11.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 4.325,
      "start": 49.447,
      "end": 53.772
    },
    {
      "sentence": "He didn't look at my daughter or reach for her toys.",
      "search_term": "abandoned toy floor",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "A child's toy lying abandoned on a bedroom floor.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_12.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 2.083,
      "start": 54.152,
      "end": 56.235
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Instead, he walked directly to the foot of the bed and leaned over, staring straight into the camera lens.",
      "search_term": "dark silhouette bed",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark silhouette leaning over a bed frame.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_13.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 5.046,
      "start": 56.696,
      "end": 61.742
    },
    {
      "sentence": "My blood turned to ice as I realized he wasn't looking at the camera at all.",
      "search_term": "person looking shocked",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A person looking shocked and terrified at a laptop screen.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_14.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.306,
      "start": 62.162,
      "end": 65.468
    },
    {
      "sentence": "He was looking at me, sleeping soundly just inches away.",
      "search_term": "person sleeping dark",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A close up of a sleeping person's face in the dark.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_15.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.946,
      "start": 65.869,
      "end": 68.815
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Then, he pressed a finger to his lips, leaned down, and whispered my own name into the microphone.",
      "search_term": "finger on lips",
      "media_type": "photo",
      "visual": "A shadowy hand making a shushing gesture.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_16.jpg",
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "start": 69.235,
      "end": 74.285
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I froze as I heard the bedroom door behind me creak open.",
      "search_term": "door handle turning",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A bedroom door handle slowly turning.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_17.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 2.604,
      "start": 74.666,
      "end": 77.27
    },
    {
      "sentence": "I realized then that the man in the video wasn't coming out of the closet anymore.",
      "search_term": "dark hallway house",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark, empty hallway outside a bedroom.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_18.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 3.447,
      "start": 77.691,
      "end": 81.138
    },
    {
      "sentence": "He was already standing right behind me.",
      "search_term": "scary shadow looming",
      "media_type": "video",
      "visual": "A dark, blurry shadow looming behind a person.",
      "asset_path": "project_assets/shot_19.mp4",
      "duration_seconds": 1.643,
      "start": 81.538,
      "end": 83.181
    }
